      "worked": "The given logarithm requires $t>0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_9(t)+\\log_{\\sqrt{3}}(t)+\\log_{\\frac13}(t)&=\\frac{\\log_3(t)}{\\log_3(9)}+\\frac{\\log_3(t)}{\\log_3(\\sqrt{3})}+\\frac{\\log_3(t)}{\\log_3(\\frac13)}\\\\\\log_9(t)+\\log_{\\sqrt{3}}(t)+\\log_{\\frac13}(t)&=\\frac a2+\\frac a{\\frac12}+\\frac a{-1}\\\\\\log_9(t)+\\log_{\\sqrt{3}}(t)+\\log_{\\frac13}(t)&=\\frac a2+2a-a\\\\\\log_9(t)+\\log_{\\sqrt{3}}(t)+\\log_{\\frac13}(t)&=\\frac{3a}{2}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
